                            Research Clinical Trials Core Laboratories Innovation\n                                                            Commercialization Initiatives Cancer Cardiovascular Immunology Neuroscience Aging Resources Centers & Institutes Ethics & Compliance Institutional Review Board Sponsored Programs Tools for Researchers About\n                                AU Checkups and conversations: Inside the President’s Summer Tour » About AU Jagwire News Leadership President Provost Administration Enrollment Student Affairs Faculty Senate We are AU! Our Mission Working at AU Traditions History Augusta, GA Resources MyAugusta Calendar of Events Brand Guidelines Portals Faculty Directory Search Augusta.edu Resources For Current Students Faculty & Staff Parents & Family Alumni & Friends Apply Giving MyAugusta Close Search Search Trending Search Terms D2L LMS Email Pounce Calendar Registrar Housing Academic Calendar Financial Aid Parking Library Human Resources Information Technology Jump to main content  Pause Video Faculty & Staff A-Z Index Degrees & Programs Libraries News Calendar Campus Maps Augusta University Faculty & Staff Faculty & Staff Life-Changing, Life-Saving Education Augusta awaits you A comprehensive research university located in the storied city of Augusta, Georgia , Augusta University provides unprecedented opportunity for faculty and staff to further\n                           their passion for teaching, discovery, service, and clinical practice on four campuses\n                           in Augusta and branch campuses across the state. At Augusta University, faculty and staff work together to teach, conduct research,\n                              practice, and provide support to our students and patients across 8 colleges and 3 schools , at our 2 libraries , and in our world class medical center. Our colleges and schools include the nation’s\n                              eighth-largest medical school, the Medical College of Georgia , the state’s only dental school, The Dental College of Georgia , and the state-of-the art School of Computer and Cyber Sciences located in the Georgia Cyber Center. Additionally, opportunities to impart knowledge\n                              and application abound in the Hull College of Business ; Katherine Reese Pamplin College of Arts, Humanities, and Social Sciences ; the Colleges of Education , Science and Mathematics , Allied Health Sciences , and Nursing ; and The Graduate School . At Augusta, our faculty and staff have the unique opportunity to be part of an intimate\n                              campus experience with small-class sizes and a diverse community of learners, while\n                              retaining access to the rich resources of Georgia’s second-largest city, including\n                              live music and performances, unique food and cultural offerings, top-rated schools\n                              and more. Augusta University’s primary campuses in Augusta are situated on the southern banks\n                              of the Savannah River. Serving as a halfway point between the Appalachian Mountains\n                              to the north and the Atlantic Ocean to the south, Augusta is a thriving community built on a solid foundation of local pride and artistic eccentricity. Need More Information? Faculty Resources Find answers to your questions or concerns by exploring these resources. Faculty Directory Provides information about instructional and administrative faculty, emeritus faculty,\n                                    & clinical/adjunct faculty. Academic Technology Support Providing support to faculty who use technology and software for teaching and learning. myAugusta Intranet All of your web tools, applications and internal information are centralized on the\n                                    intranet. JagWire University and AU Health news published online daily and weekly by email. Faculty Affairs Dedicated to creating an environment that promotes the success of our faculty, beginning\n                                    with recruitment and hiring, and continuing throughout their career. Staff Council Facilitating staff connections and communication to foster a more engaging and collaborative\n                                    professional environment. Human Resources Serving Augusta University faculty and staff. Jobs & Careers Employment opportunities for current employees and external applicants. Faculty Senate Helping faculty share in the operation and management of the university's shared governance. Augusta's River Region Learn more about Augusta and the surrounding area. VIRTUAL TOUR Explore Our Campus While there is nothing quite like visiting in person, our virtual tour is designed\n                           to showcase the beauty, history, and innovative energy of Augusta University. Virtually,\n                           you can explore our Summerville and Health Sciences campuses in the comfort of your\n                           own home. Discover Faculty & Staff News Using tech tools for faster response and a safer campus New cameras, electronic door security, and emergency response technology are providing the Augusta University Police Department (AUPD) and IT Physical Security with additional tools to help protect the AU community. What if an emergency happened on campus? A call comes into AUPD. Officers need to know where the situation is happening and what is unfolding around them. At […] Using tech tools for faster response and a safer campus Back on campus? Start with these IT resources These IT resources are among the most frequently accessed by faculty, staff and students during the first weeks of the semester. Bookmark them now so they're easy to find. Back on campus? Start with these IT resources Pamplin professor wins 2026 Regents' Scholarship of Teaching and Learning Award \"Deborah Richardson's work bridges rigorous research and meaningful classroom practice in a way that has influenced generations of students and faculty,\" says Kim Davies, PhD. Pamplin professor wins 2026 Regents' Scholarship of Teaching and Learning Award Augusta University celebrates faculty commitment to teaching excellence The Center for Instructional Innovation at Augusta University recognized 53 faculty members for their ongoing professional growth. Augusta University celebrates faculty commitment to teaching excellence Augusta University 1120 15th Street, Augusta, GA 30912 Campus Maps Campus Contacts A-Z Directory Degrees & Programs Employment Accessibility Accreditation Campus Safety Compliance Hotline Human Trafficking Notice Privacy Notices Title IX / Sexual Misconduct Apply Now Give Now © 2026 Augusta University Augusta University Facebook Augusta University Twitter Augusta University LinkedIn Augusta University Youtube Augusta University Instagram"
    },
