                            Research Clinical Trials Core Laboratories Innovation\n                                                            Commercialization Initiatives Cancer Cardiovascular Immunology Neuroscience Aging Resources Centers & Institutes Ethics & Compliance Institutional Review Board Sponsored Programs Tools for Researchers About\n                                AU Checkups and conversations: Inside the President’s Summer Tour » About AU Jagwire News Leadership President Provost Administration Enrollment Student Affairs Faculty Senate We are AU! Our Mission Working at AU Traditions History Augusta, GA Resources MyAugusta Calendar of Events Brand Guidelines Portals Faculty Directory Search Augusta.edu Resources For Current Students Faculty & Staff Parents & Family Alumni & Friends Apply Giving MyAugusta Close Search Search Trending Search Terms D2L LMS Email Pounce Calendar Registrar Housing Academic Calendar Financial Aid Parking Library Human Resources Information Technology Pursue Your Ambitions Career Services Helping you navigate your career path Career Services About Events Jaguar Job Fair Upcoming Events Resources on Demand Big Interview Career Assessment Career Guide Resume Guides Parker Dewey Micro-Internships Candid Career Videos Buzzfile Industry/Major IRIS Photo Booth Students Major & Career Exploration Job Search Preparation Internships Jags On-Campus Find a Job Job Fairs Career Advisors Employers Faculty & Staff Handshake Augusta University Career Services Career Services Augusta University Career Services provides comprehensive and personalized career\n                        guidance for students through: Career and major exploration Job search preparation Employment support (part and full-time, internships, and more) Professional development programming (workshops, career fairs, networking and more) By aligning career preparation with academic planning, we empower students with strategies\n                        for long-term career success. About Career Services Contact Us Career Services Summerville Campus University Hall Suite 210 706-737-1604 706-731-7097 careercenter@augusta.edu Facebook Instagram LinkedIn Resources Job Search Preparation Find the tools needed to begin your job search and help you become the best candidate Job Search Preparation Career Guide An overview of who we are and what we do, as well as resources to help you in your\n                                    career search Career Guide Major & Career Exploration The first step in choosing a major or career is understanding who you are through\n                                       career assessments Major & Career Exploration Find A Job Current students can find on and off campus job opportunities using Handshake - our\n                                       jobs, events, and appointment portal Find A Job Jags On-Campus Internship Program This program gives Augusta University students a paid, structured, and campus-based\n                                       internship experience, bringing classroom learning to life Jags On-Campus Internship Program Job Fairs & Events Annual campus job fairs and upcoming Career Services events Job Fairs & Events Hire AU Students Opportunities for employers to engage and acquire outstanding talent for your organization Hire AU Students Request a Program AU faculty, staff and students, invite Career Services to present your class or student\n                                       organization Request a Program Professional Headshot Booth by IRIS Free resource for Augusta University students and staff to get their professional\n                                       headshot taken Professional Headshot Booth by IRIS College to Career Checklist Tips for jaguars to pounce from student to professional College to Career Checklist News & Events Sep 09 Masters Tournament Recruitment 11:00 AM - 2:00 PM Masters Tournament Recruitment Sep 14 Winshape Tabling 10:00 AM - 3:00 PM Winshape Tabling Sep 15 Winshape Tabling 10:00 AM - 3:00 PM Winshape Tabling Sep 15 Career Loading...Start With an Internship 2:00 PM - 3:00 PM Career Loading...Start With an Internship Employer Resources Recruitment Options Explore ways to build your brand, conduct information sessions and on-campus interviews,\n                                                connect with student organizations, and more. Recruitment Options Sponsorships Being a partner or sponsor with Augusta University's Career Services helps establish\n                                                a campus presence to foster an organization's recruitment needs. Sponsorships Shape Shape Shape Shape Student Success Stories Aaron Maxwell, Radiation Therapy Program Augusta University Despite not having the most competitive scores in my classes, the career services office helped me show my worth in my program interview. They taught me how to show the higher ups in the program that I am more than just my grades and that I would be not only a great fit for the program, but a asset to the school as a whole. I utilized Career Services resources such as mock interviews with Mr. V, and resume builders on the website. More Success Stories Share Your Story Augusta University 1120 15th Street, Augusta, GA 30912 Campus Maps Campus Contacts A-Z Directory Degrees & Programs Employment Accessibility Accreditation Campus Safety Compliance Hotline Human Trafficking Notice Privacy Notices Title IX / Sexual Misconduct Apply Now Give Now © 2026 Augusta University Augusta University Facebook Augusta University Twitter Augusta University LinkedIn Augusta University Youtube Augusta University Instagram"
