national visitors and employees\n                        to campus. Our Services For International Scholars & Students Provide  an orientation session after arrival in the U.S. Assist with traveling outside the U.S., program extensions, and other issues related\n                           to immigration status Organize informational and social events that provide a cross-cultural experience Appointment Request AU International End of Duration of Status For Augusta University Departments Provide information about visa status options for sponsoring/hosting scholars, employees\n                           and students Assist with recruiting international faculty and sponsoring current personnel for\n                           permanent residency Assist with the appointment of all postdoctoral fellows Immigration Consultation Interview Consultation AU International Contact Us IPSO Health Sciences Campus Annex II HT 2402 706-721-0670 706-721-9304 ipso@augusta.edu Get Information Department Managers → J-1 Exchange Visitors → International Students → H-1B,TN,O-1,E-3 Employees → Prospective International Students → About Our International Population 5 International Students at Augusta University 3 International Visiting Scholars at Augusta University 3 International Employees at Augusta University Newsletters and Announcements Most Recent Newsletters & Announcements IPSO Facto - Sept 2025 - Newsletter for dept. managers and administrators The J Connection - Sept 2025 - Newsletter for J-1 Exchange Visitors The Frontier - Sept 2025 - Newsletter for F-1 International Students F-Frontier - Sept 2025 - Newsletter for F-1 OPT and STEM OPT International Students IPSO Facto - Sept 2024 - Newsletter for dept. managers and administrators Archives Talk to an Advisor Advisors are available for Augusta University faculty, staff, visiting scholars, enrolled\n                                 students and their spouses for questions concerning immigration status as it pertains\n            